WEBVTT

00:05.430 --> 00:10.390
<i>There are only four books on 
alchemy in such a large library.</i>

00:10.900 --> 00:15.240
<i>Why has alchemy died out so much 
when the way it works is so simple?</i>

00:16.010 --> 00:16.870
<i>Hold on.</i>

00:17.270 --> 00:18.580
<i>I see.</i>

00:18.580 --> 00:21.760
<i>Because it's based on the writing 
of an ancient magic civilization.</i>

00:23.440 --> 00:25.130
<i>Since I reincarnated into this world,</i>

00:25.130 --> 00:27.770
<i>I'm able to understand all of its languages.</i>

00:28.510 --> 00:30.850
<i>That's likely due to Lady Nolyn's blessing.</i>

00:30.850 --> 00:33.090
<i>That must be why I find it simple.</i>

00:34.520 --> 00:37.940
I don't think I'll be able 
to forget that for a while.

00:37.940 --> 00:38.730
Forget what?

00:38.730 --> 00:40.160
It was so lovely!

00:40.160 --> 00:42.000
The sight of you two yesterday.

00:42.000 --> 00:43.940
Huh? Were you watching?

00:43.940 --> 00:44.940
Yes!

00:44.940 --> 00:47.010
I had a front-row seat!

00:47.390 --> 00:49.230
<i>Master, so cool.</i>

00:49.230 --> 00:51.760
Seeing Sofia like that!

00:52.310 --> 00:55.310
She was just like a knight 
vowing to protect a princess!

00:55.310 --> 00:57.160
It was so enchanting!

00:57.160 --> 00:59.520
Does that make <i>me</i>
the princess then?!

00:59.520 --> 01:01.340
<i>Master, so cute.</i>

02:35.450 --> 02:38.610
We made a lot of these toilets, huh?

02:35.460 --> 02:40.430
<b>Episode 4
Takumi's Party's First Battle!</b>

02:35.460 --> 02:40.430
<b>Episode 4
Takumi's Party's First Battle!</b>

02:38.610 --> 02:41.590
Yeah, I should be able 
to fill the order today.

02:42.170 --> 02:45.730
Now I think I'll get a break 
from mass-producing toilets.

02:45.730 --> 02:49.360
Then are you going to be 
producing something else?

02:49.360 --> 02:51.700
I will keep producing things,

02:51.700 --> 02:55.860
but I'm also thinking of going on 
 a journey whenever I feel like it.

02:55.860 --> 02:57.790
A journey?

02:58.230 --> 03:01.130
I want to try finding materials and 
meals unique to certain places,

03:02.020 --> 03:04.580
see unique sights,
explore some ruins,

03:04.580 --> 03:06.320
and have fun doing it.

03:07.050 --> 03:10.670
I'll have Sofia accompanying 
me as my bodyguard,

03:10.960 --> 03:14.760
so I'll probably ask you to hold 
down the fort while we're gone.

03:15.550 --> 03:16.780
<i>And me?</i>

03:17.230 --> 03:19.960
You're my pet, Maple.
So you'd come with me.

03:20.630 --> 03:22.020
Um...

03:22.020 --> 03:25.980
If I said I wanted to go with 
you too, would I be a nuisance?

03:25.980 --> 03:28.470
Huh? Hm...

03:28.470 --> 03:33.670
I imagine it'll be dangerous, 
and I need your help with our home—

03:33.670 --> 03:39.420
Handling all the housework by myself in a
 mansion without you, Sofia, or Maple...

03:39.770 --> 03:45.070
That's like being a toilet left all 
alone and isolated in a burning desert!

03:45.070 --> 03:49.150
I'd be even lower than that!

03:49.430 --> 03:52.130
<i>Why do all her metaphors
involve toilets?</i>

03:52.130 --> 03:53.850
<i>Though, now that I think about it,</i>

03:53.850 --> 03:57.350
<i>I would be worried about leaving 
Maria alone in such a big mansion.</i>

04:03.250 --> 04:06.560
<i>When she gives me that look—</i>

04:06.940 --> 04:08.650
Pardon me for a moment.

