04:14.980 --> 04:26.200
<b>Short Swordsmanship Lv4, Martial Arts Lv2,
Enemy Detection Lv2, Sense Presence Lv2,
Stealth Lv2, Sense Magic Lv1,
Mana Manipulation Lv2, Fire Magic Lv2,
Water Magic Lv2, Earth Magic Lv3, Sewing Lv3,
Cooking Lv3</b>

04:15.830 --> 04:16.570
Huh?

04:17.560 --> 04:20.360
Mr. Takumi?

04:20.360 --> 04:22.380
<i>These stats aren't bad at all!</i>

04:22.380 --> 04:25.740
<i>She's a battle maid, capable of combat!</i>

04:26.310 --> 04:28.780
Your stats are good enough.

04:28.780 --> 04:31.120
But are you really sure you want to go?

04:31.120 --> 04:33.210
I'm well aware of the danger!

04:33.210 --> 04:36.410
Mr. Takumi, I also request
 that she accompany us.

04:36.790 --> 04:40.620
I believe I can teach her 
magic and how to fight.

04:40.620 --> 04:42.180
Sofia!

04:42.180 --> 04:45.750
Then could I ask you to 
train with me and Sofia?

04:45.750 --> 04:47.080
Mr. Takumi!

04:49.660 --> 04:54.010
Now that that's settled, I think I'll 
make weapons and armor for you two.

04:54.620 --> 04:56.060
What kind of weapons would you like?

04:56.060 --> 04:57.950
I'd like a longsword

04:57.950 --> 05:01.020
and a spear about
two and a half meters long.

05:01.250 --> 05:02.650
A longbow for range,

05:02.650 --> 05:04.570
and also one or two knives.

05:03.090 --> 05:05.070
<i>She listed those without any hesitation.</i>

05:05.070 --> 05:06.740
<i>As expected from a warrior.</i>

05:06.740 --> 05:08.230
You don't need a shield?

05:08.470 --> 05:12.410
If I may, I'd like a 
buckler that isn't too bulky.

05:12.410 --> 05:14.880
What kind of weapons would 
you like to use, Maria?

05:14.880 --> 05:18.250
I was trained in short blades
 at the Mulan Trading Company,

05:18.250 --> 05:21.080
so basically any short sword 
or knife should be good.

05:21.080 --> 05:25.470
If that's all you have, then you'll be 
lacking in attack power against monsters.

05:25.470 --> 05:26.830
I see.

05:26.830 --> 05:28.270
How about a spear?

05:28.270 --> 05:30.370
I could teach you how to use one.

05:30.370 --> 05:32.610
Yes! Please do!

05:35.960 --> 05:38.760
<i>Ingots of magical steel should 
work for the material.</i>

05:39.330 --> 05:44.350
<i>In this world, metal needs more than 
hardness, or there's no point in using it.</i>

05:47.310 --> 05:49.270
Lower center of gravity!

05:51.440 --> 05:53.150
You're not extending your arms enough!

05:53.580 --> 05:54.710
Like this!

05:54.710 --> 05:56.650
Oh!

06:01.260 --> 06:02.880
Phew.

