<b>Job</b>

06:02.750 --> 06:04.460
<b>Blacksmith</b>

06:02.750 --> 06:04.460
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

06:02.880 --> 06:05.930
That really shaves away the mana.

06:06.830 --> 06:08.880
<i>I added a wing pattern to the 
design of Sofia's spear,</i>

06:08.720 --> 06:09.550
<b>Skill</b>

06:08.720 --> 06:09.550
<b>Metalworking</b>

06:08.720 --> 06:09.550
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

06:09.870 --> 06:13.500
<i>and a flame pattern to Maria's spear.</i>

06:13.390 --> 06:14.010
<b>Skill</b>

06:13.390 --> 06:14.010
<b>Metalworking</b>

06:13.390 --> 06:14.010
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

06:14.300 --> 06:18.730
<i>Now to cast the Enhance Attack
 and Auto-Repair enchantments...</i>

06:20.400 --> 06:21.730
<i>and done!</i>

06:22.360 --> 06:24.690
Next comes Maria's short blades,

06:25.020 --> 06:26.720
but since she's a battle maid...

06:27.520 --> 06:30.040
<i>She needs knives on her thighs!</i>

06:32.370 --> 06:36.320
Idiot! Idiot!

06:34.060 --> 06:36.320
Yes, I'm an idiot.

06:38.040 --> 06:39.130
What's wrong?

06:39.130 --> 06:42.820
I just a felt a chill on my thigh.

06:43.500 --> 06:45.960
<i>Next is their armor...</i>

06:45.960 --> 06:48.820
<i>but I'll need to get their measurements.</i>

06:49.320 --> 06:53.120
<i>It wouldn't do for me 
to ask to measure them.</i>

06:56.240 --> 06:58.490
Luckily, I'm prepared!

06:59.310 --> 07:01.430
Da-da-da-dan!

07:02.260 --> 07:05.050
<i>Sofia and Maria dolls?</i>

07:05.050 --> 07:08.710
I made them with the help of Appraisal EX!

07:12.920 --> 07:15.280
Th-This is scandalous.

07:15.280 --> 07:17.670
<i>Sofia and Maria, both scandalous?</i>

07:18.550 --> 07:21.400
Maple, can I count on you 
for some spider silk?!

07:21.400 --> 07:22.370
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

07:22.860 --> 07:26.550
I'll use the Huge Armored Boar's 
carapace and hide for materials.

07:26.550 --> 07:29.910
Then I'll add in cloth made 
from Maple's threads.

07:30.710 --> 07:32.140
So, for the design...

07:32.530 --> 07:36.290
Functionality is important, 
but appearance is important too, right?

07:36.730 --> 07:40.530
I'm exercising my right as your master...

07:41.380 --> 07:43.980
<i>and letting my tastes run wild!</i>

07:43.980 --> 07:46.440
<b>Several Days Later</b>

07:46.440 --> 07:48.990
Oh!

07:48.990 --> 07:52.100
They look so <i>good!</i>

07:52.100 --> 07:55.010
How does wearing them feel? 
Is the fit right?

07:55.010 --> 07:57.010
It's a surprisingly perfect fit!

07:57.010 --> 07:59.470
Yes. It feels like it adapted 
to me the moment I put it on.

07:59.470 --> 08:01.320
It's really easy to move around in!

08:01.670 --> 08:05.540
How did you manage to 
match our sizes so well?

08:05.540 --> 08:07.630
<i>He used dolls of you two—</i>

08:07.630 --> 08:11.710
It should be good on the defensive 
end too, thanks to the spider silk!

08:11.710 --> 08:13.250
H-How about the weapons?

08:15.410 --> 08:17.210
It feels right in my grip.

08:17.210 --> 08:20.430
Yes! Sounds like the enchantments 
are working well.

08:23.120 --> 08:24.510
Feel nice!

08:24.510 --> 08:27.380
<i>Looks very nice! A wonderful sight!</i>

08:27.380 --> 08:28.920
<i>Yes, I'm an idiot!</i>

08:28.920 --> 08:30.740
<i>Go ahead and laugh!</i>

08:31.610 --> 08:33.220
Thank you so much.

08:33.220 --> 08:35.440
I can work hard in this!

08:35.440 --> 08:38.120
Good, good! Also, here.

08:38.900 --> 08:40.430
Rings?

08:40.430 --> 08:43.420
I figured they could serve well 
as focuses for casting magic.

08:42.450 --> 08:43.660
<b>Mythril Magical Rings</b>

08:42.450 --> 08:43.660
<b><b>• Enhance Magic Power (LG)
• Assist Spell Control (LG)
• Assist Mana Manipulation (LG)
• Auto-Adjust Sizing</b></b>

08:42.450 --> 08:43.660
<b>m 0 0 l 180 0 180 48 0 48}</b>

08:44.360 --> 08:46.200
They're imbued with mana.

08:46.200 --> 08:48.490
Mr. Takumi, you've gone so far...

08:49.230 --> 08:51.830
Producing these consumed a 
lot of mana, didn't it?

08:51.830 --> 08:55.300
Well, it was training for 
my production skills, too.

08:55.610 --> 08:59.990
Thanks to that, I've obtained 
ice magic and lightning magic.

08:59.990 --> 09:01.660
Thank you so much!

09:02.270 --> 09:03.530
It's nothing!

09:05.450 --> 09:08.380
<i>We made our way to
the Adventurer's Guild.</i>

09:08.860 --> 09:10.400
<i>Before going on a journey,</i>

09:10.400 --> 09:14.430
<i>Sofia and Maria need to 
be registered with the guild.</i>

09:15.320 --> 09:18.560
Here are your guild cards.

09:18.560 --> 09:20.020
Both rank H.

09:20.020 --> 09:21.630
Thank you so much.

09:21.980 --> 09:25.840
Okay, I'd also like to register 
the three of us as a party.

09:25.840 --> 09:28.840
Understood. By the way, Takumi...

09:28.840 --> 09:31.300
About the routine message 
we sent the other day...

09:31.300 --> 09:32.240
Oh, yes!

09:32.240 --> 09:33.710
The quests!

09:33.710 --> 09:36.010
I came here today hoping to handle that, too.

09:36.300 --> 09:37.330
Very well.

09:38.760 --> 09:43.210
I guess for now we'll try taking 
rank H and G quests.

09:43.720 --> 09:47.830
But Mr. Takumi, you won't earn 
any points if we do that, right?

09:47.830 --> 09:49.050
That's fine.

09:49.050 --> 09:52.510
I'm not exactly trying to 
raise my rank within the guild.

09:52.510 --> 09:54.640
Hey, ladies.

09:54.880 --> 09:59.600
We can show you the ropes 
better than that weakling can.

09:59.600 --> 10:02.440
We're all rank D, y'know.

10:02.440 --> 10:05.320
We're much more
reliable than that guy.

10:05.320 --> 10:09.280
Boy, these two are practically
saying they'd prefer us!

10:09.280 --> 10:11.930
Now, let's start...

10:12.490 --> 10:14.010
Huh? What?

10:14.290 --> 10:17.930
You ain't thinking you 
can oppose me, are ya?

10:18.270 --> 10:19.330
Mr. Takumi!

10:20.600 --> 10:21.690
<i>I'm terrified!</i>

10:21.690 --> 10:23.940
<i>Internally, I'm </i>really<i> scared!</i>

10:23.940 --> 10:25.010
<i>But...</i>

10:25.010 --> 10:28.650
<i>Both of them are my precious friends!</i>

10:28.650 --> 10:32.300
Guess ya ain't gonna understand 
until we teach your body.

10:32.300 --> 10:34.040
Rude <i>and</i> vulgar.

10:34.610 --> 10:35.890
Huh?!

10:35.890 --> 10:40.570
You're nothing like the three members 
of Lion Fang that I met before.

10:40.570 --> 10:41.910
Why, you!

10:44.500 --> 10:45.830
Debul?! What happened?!

10:45.830 --> 10:47.440
My hand!

10:46.450 --> 10:48.410
<b>Skill</b>

10:46.450 --> 10:48.410
<b>Physical Enhancement</b>

10:46.450 --> 10:48.410
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

10:48.650 --> 10:50.360
You bastard!

10:50.690 --> 10:53.590
What the hell're you bastards doing?!

10:56.580 --> 10:59.510
Was this your doing?

10:59.510 --> 11:01.110
Uhh...

11:01.110 --> 11:03.470
Mr. Takumi hasn't done anything!

11:03.470 --> 11:06.930
He hasn't? But this
guy's injured, ain't he?

11:07.470 --> 11:08.910
Guildmaster.

11:08.910 --> 11:12.640
They picked the fight, and Takumi 
just stood there and got hit.

11:13.730 --> 11:14.870
Guildmaster?

11:15.100 --> 11:19.560
This is Barack, current guildmaster
of the Adventurer's Guild.

11:19.950 --> 11:22.840
Hey, heal this bastard.

11:24.300 --> 11:25.880
Come with me.

11:27.090 --> 11:28.700
So, what'd you do?

11:28.700 --> 11:30.790
What did I do...?

11:32.000 --> 11:34.110
Do I have to say?

11:34.110 --> 11:36.230
We protect personal information.

11:36.780 --> 11:39.990
There were faint traces of mana,

11:39.990 --> 11:41.760
so was it magic?

11:44.010 --> 11:45.970
<i>If he can sense lingering traces,</i>

11:45.970 --> 11:49.000
<i>then his Sense Magic Skill 
must be quite a high level.</i>

11:49.940 --> 11:51.930
I'm surprised you noticed.

11:51.930 --> 11:55.230
Though I didn't cast any magic on those men.

11:57.570 --> 12:03.710
I just pulled out some charcoal from my 
Item Box and coated my upper body in it.

12:04.190 --> 12:06.470
It was really just charcoal?

12:06.470 --> 12:10.410
Oh, no, I synthesized it into diamond.

12:10.800 --> 12:13.620
Well, that'd break a fist.

12:13.620 --> 12:15.130
Alchemy?

12:15.130 --> 12:16.170
Yes.

12:16.170 --> 12:20.270
That reminds me, when you first came here, 
you wanted to join an Alchemist's Guild.

12:20.270 --> 12:21.360
Yes.

12:21.360 --> 12:23.530
Though you said there are none.

12:23.880 --> 12:26.350
Alright, I get the gist.

12:26.710 --> 12:29.990
You ladies are his party members, right?

12:31.050 --> 12:33.700
With such pretty women with him...

12:33.700 --> 12:39.020
Guild Master, I think we should 
immediately promote him to rank D.

12:39.020 --> 12:40.150
Indeed.

12:40.150 --> 12:44.270
If we do that, then you'll see less idiots 
like that tryin' to make a move on ya.

12:44.270 --> 12:48.580
So you say, but they both 
just registered today.

12:48.580 --> 12:49.770
What do you think?

12:49.770 --> 12:52.370
Would you be willing to accept 
some quests I selected

12:52.370 --> 12:55.660
to help all three of you 
rank up more easily?

12:57.800 --> 13:00.060
I think it's a good deal.

13:00.060 --> 13:03.350
I'll risk my life to protect you,

13:03.680 --> 13:07.430
but I agree with improving 
our abilities and our rank.

13:07.430 --> 13:11.630
I want to be helpful to Mr. Takumi
as soon as possible too!

13:12.730 --> 13:14.720
Then, if you could.

13:15.460 --> 13:16.600
Very well. Let's begin.

13:21.640 --> 13:24.370
<i>Hans had prepared three quests for us.</i>

13:25.270 --> 13:27.060
<i>A quest to exterminate goblins,</i>

13:27.060 --> 13:28.920
<i>a quest to exterminate kobolds,</i>

13:28.920 --> 13:31.530
<i>and a quest to gather Marill Herbs.</i>

13:31.530 --> 13:34.000
<i>Master, past the bushes.</i>

13:34.270 --> 13:35.960
<i>Four gobs.</i>

13:36.440 --> 13:38.270
Report from our scout.

13:38.270 --> 13:40.230
Four in the bushes ahead.

13:40.230 --> 13:42.080
I'll kill two of them.

13:48.270 --> 13:51.780
<i>All three were either 
any-rank or rank G quests.</i>

13:55.930 --> 13:59.390
<i>The reward was around five or six 
silver coins, which wasn't bad.</i>

13:58.070 --> 14:00.890
Okay, let's retrieve their magic stones.

14:01.480 --> 14:06.850
That aside, aren't we encountering 
goblins and kobolds at a high rate?

14:07.430 --> 14:11.110
We've already killed enough to complete 
the quests three times over, right?

14:11.680 --> 14:15.250
There's likely a medium-sized 
encampment nearby,

14:15.250 --> 14:17.780
and there might be a 
general among them.

14:18.260 --> 14:19.990
A Goblin General?

14:20.290 --> 14:22.170
That's a rank C monster.

14:22.170 --> 14:26.940
It's generally said to take at least 
five parties of rank D or higher

14:26.940 --> 14:30.010
to exterminate an encampment 
dominated by one of them.

14:30.720 --> 14:33.620
That's not us, right?

14:33.620 --> 14:35.590
If we use my sprite magic,

14:35.590 --> 14:37.480
your elemental magic,

14:37.480 --> 14:39.770
and Maria's earth magic

14:39.770 --> 14:42.680
to launch area attacks at the 
start and thin out their numbers,

14:43.620 --> 14:47.400
then I believe we have a strong chance 
of exterminating them on our own.

14:47.810 --> 14:49.260
<i>Oh, she's ready to do it.</i>

14:49.260 --> 14:51.690
<i>She's totally in combat mode.</i>

14:51.690 --> 14:53.300
Pest extermination!

14:53.300 --> 14:54.490
I'm itching to go!

14:54.490 --> 14:55.610
<i>Her, too.</i>

14:55.870 --> 14:57.080
<i>Master.</i>

14:57.080 --> 14:58.380
What is it, Maple?

14:58.380 --> 14:59.690
Are you hurt?

14:59.690 --> 15:02.330
<i>I evolve... soon.</i>

15:02.660 --> 15:04.260
<i>Evolve</i>?!

15:04.260 --> 15:05.290
Right now?!

15:05.290 --> 15:06.520
Got it!

15:06.520 --> 15:08.840
Get in here and rest!

15:10.790 --> 15:14.270
Was that... a Pocket Dimension?

15:15.120 --> 15:16.120
Yeah.

15:16.120 --> 15:20.720
I was able to create it once my 
space-time magic reached level 3.

15:21.430 --> 15:25.340
We don't have Maple's backup anymore, 
so it's just the three of us now.

15:26.190 --> 15:27.430
That's plenty.

15:30.280 --> 15:31.940
There are three or four hundred.

15:31.940 --> 15:35.110
Umm... do we <i>have</i> to do this?

15:35.420 --> 15:37.990
I confirmed the numbers with a wind sprite.

15:37.990 --> 15:41.460
There aren't any people in there, 
so we'll hit them with magic.

15:46.180 --> 15:47.980
Wind Sprite's Tempered Blades!

15:47.980 --> 15:49.590
Rock Pile!

15:49.590 --> 15:51.220
Fire Storm!

16:00.020 --> 16:01.410
Did we get them?!

16:01.410 --> 16:03.720
No, not yet.

16:06.290 --> 16:08.740
There's a Goblin General 
and a Goblin Knight.

16:08.740 --> 16:10.020
Both advanced species!

16:13.450 --> 16:14.570
<b>Goblin General</b>

16:13.450 --> 16:14.570
<b>Condition</b>

16:13.450 --> 16:14.570
<b>Enraged</b>

16:16.030 --> 16:17.990
<b>Skill</b>

16:16.030 --> 16:17.990
<b>Intuition</b>

16:16.030 --> 16:17.990
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

16:17.280 --> 16:17.990
<b>Skill</b>

16:17.280 --> 16:17.990
<b>Physical Enhancement</b>

16:17.280 --> 16:17.990
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

16:17.990 --> 16:20.700
<b>Skill</b>

16:17.990 --> 16:20.700
<b>Spearmanship</b>

16:17.990 --> 16:20.700
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

16:18.700 --> 16:20.700
<b>Skill</b>

16:18.700 --> 16:20.700
<b>Martial Arts</b>

16:18.700 --> 16:20.700
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

16:19.540 --> 16:20.700
<b>Skill</b>

16:19.540 --> 16:20.700
<b>Magic Combat</b>

16:19.540 --> 16:20.700
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

16:20.700 --> 16:22.690
Here I go!

16:29.650 --> 16:31.910
You completed them all in half a day?

16:31.910 --> 16:32.860
Yes.

16:33.250 --> 16:35.970
We've completed all the quests.

16:36.830 --> 16:39.750
Could you come to the back for a bit?

16:39.750 --> 16:41.760
I'll go summon the guildmaster.

16:44.370 --> 16:46.510
Look here!

16:46.510 --> 16:50.950
That requires an extermination squad with 
multiple rank D or higher members, y'know?

16:50.950 --> 16:53.800
Yeah, that's what I'd heard.

16:53.800 --> 16:55.790
You "heard"?!

16:56.190 --> 16:57.850
Listen, you!

16:59.450 --> 17:01.130
Sorry for the wait!

17:02.290 --> 17:04.600
Maple is reborn!

17:05.410 --> 17:06.620
Maple?!

17:06.620 --> 17:08.000
An Arachne?

17:08.000 --> 17:11.120
Oh, my! Maple! You've grown cuter!

17:11.340 --> 17:13.900
Maria! I've wanted to speak to you!

17:13.900 --> 17:16.840
Oh, my! You can talk now, too?!

17:17.170 --> 17:18.860
Forget it.

17:18.860 --> 17:21.850
You guys are amazing, huh.

17:21.850 --> 17:24.490
I'll go prepare your reward.

17:24.490 --> 17:27.280
Also, Takumi is promoted to rank E,

17:27.280 --> 17:30.600
and both Sofia and Maria 
are promoted to rank F.

17:31.550 --> 17:34.740
Mr. Takumi, do you have a moment?

17:34.740 --> 17:36.050
What's up?

17:36.370 --> 17:40.900
Well, if you have any scraps of cloth, 
I was hoping I could have some.

17:40.900 --> 17:43.690
Scraps? If you need cloth, ask Maple—

17:43.690 --> 17:44.760
Heavens no!

17:44.760 --> 17:48.830
Maple's thread and cloth is too 
high-quality, so it would be wasted!

17:48.830 --> 17:50.220
What are you going to use it for?

17:50.220 --> 17:51.410
Well...

17:51.410 --> 17:54.360
I was going to make
 underwear for me and Sofia.

17:54.360 --> 17:55.380
Underwear?

17:55.380 --> 17:57.930
Wouldn't that be hard to make with scraps?

17:57.930 --> 17:59.620
No, it isn't.

17:59.620 --> 18:01.880
You just thread a few together.

18:03.410 --> 18:04.860
Like this.

18:05.160 --> 18:05.870
Huh?!

18:05.870 --> 18:08.560
No, underwear's like this, right?!

18:08.560 --> 18:10.770
Brassiere

18:08.560 --> 18:10.770
Women's Panties

18:13.180 --> 18:16.200
Should I try making a set for you?

18:17.360 --> 18:20.650
Ah, I'm sorry! I take it back!

18:20.650 --> 18:22.770
Please do! Please!

18:22.770 --> 18:24.420
Oh! Yes!

18:25.030 --> 18:27.160
Master, Papek is here.

18:27.590 --> 18:28.910
Papek?

18:31.280 --> 18:33.730
Why is he unconscious?

18:33.730 --> 18:37.050
He passed out when he saw me, 
so I threw him in here.

18:37.050 --> 18:39.760
Oh, so he was shocked by your evolution.

18:41.370 --> 18:45.280
<i>Papek had come with a request</i>

18:45.280 --> 18:49.330
<i>from the Lord of Bolton, Marquis Godwin. 
He wanted to meet me.</i>

18:50.220 --> 18:53.180
Wh-Why does the Lord want to see <i>me</i>?!

18:53.180 --> 18:56.650
I believe it's about the 
purification magic devices.

18:57.250 --> 18:58.930
The toilets?

18:58.930 --> 19:03.110
That reminds me, you mentioned having 
a lead on some backing

19:03.110 --> 19:05.950
that would prevent interference
 from the Holy Empire of Sidonia.

19:06.680 --> 19:08.080
But was that...

19:08.380 --> 19:13.280
Yes, the Lord. His Excellency, 
Marquis Godwin Bolton.

19:13.590 --> 19:17.370
<i>I couldn't refuse, 
given my and Papek's positions.</i>

19:19.310 --> 19:24.500
Mr. Iruma, the magical device you created 
to purify waste is truly wonderful.

19:24.500 --> 19:27.550
Thanks to you, the sanitation 
of the city has improved,

19:27.550 --> 19:29.510
helping us prevent disease outbreaks.

19:29.510 --> 19:32.750
We owe you a great deal.

19:33.940 --> 19:35.250
You have my thanks.

19:35.970 --> 19:39.660
Please, sir. You needn't 
bow your head to me.

19:39.940 --> 19:45.360
Why not? If bowing my head will improve my 
domain, then I'll bow as much as it takes.

19:45.360 --> 19:47.300
<i>He seems like a good lord.</i>

19:45.990 --> 19:48.330
You also exterminated 
the goblin encampment.

19:48.910 --> 19:53.790
You have my thanks again for dealing with 
something my own knights had overlooked.

19:54.010 --> 19:56.990
No, we were just fulfilling 
our quest from the guild.

19:56.990 --> 20:00.100
Normally that would be 
the job of my knights.

20:00.100 --> 20:02.610
The knight captain is
grateful to you, too.

20:02.610 --> 20:03.800
Mr. Iruma.

20:03.800 --> 20:07.660
I'd like you to put yourself 
first from now on.

20:07.660 --> 20:09.220
If something were to happen to you,

20:09.220 --> 20:13.660
it would be a great loss for the land of
Bolton, as well as our entire kingdom.

20:14.030 --> 20:15.470
I believe that's overstating things.

20:15.470 --> 20:20.360
You mustn't let your guard down, 
especially once the Holy Empire of Sidonia

20:20.360 --> 20:21.940
starts coming for you.

20:24.740 --> 20:26.590
I'm mentally drained.

20:27.150 --> 20:28.270
Master.

20:28.270 --> 20:29.780
I finished them.

20:29.780 --> 20:33.250
What was I trying to make again?

20:34.420 --> 20:35.920
<i>Underwear.</i>

20:36.620 --> 20:38.540
<i></i>Women's<i> panties.</i>

20:38.800 --> 20:42.680
Master, you look more stern now than 
when you fought the Goblin General.

20:43.110 --> 20:44.220
Thank you!

20:45.660 --> 20:50.520
They're... finally... done...

20:50.520 --> 20:52.790
Um, Mr. Takumi...

20:52.790 --> 20:56.990
You were holed up in your workshop for three 
whole days making this underwear, right?

20:56.990 --> 20:58.190
That's right.

20:58.580 --> 20:59.470
Still...

20:59.190 --> 21:02.150
<b>Sewing</b>

20:59.470 --> 21:02.160
You look like you've 
completely exhausted yourself.

21:02.780 --> 21:04.480
They're very pretty.

21:04.480 --> 21:06.100
Yes! They're so cute!

21:06.640 --> 21:08.080
You want to try them on?

21:10.650 --> 21:13.600
No! That was inappropriate of me! I'm sorry!

21:13.600 --> 21:16.680
Would... you be happy if 
we wore these, Mr. Takumi?

21:16.680 --> 21:17.550
Huh?

21:17.550 --> 21:20.520
If it'll make you happy, I'll put them on.

21:22.680 --> 21:24.650
I could never!

21:25.580 --> 21:28.980
Mr. Takumi is quite a wuss, isn't he?

21:28.980 --> 21:30.940
Maria, that's rude.

21:30.940 --> 21:33.350
Then what do you think, Sofia?

21:34.010 --> 21:35.470
Coward...

21:36.610 --> 21:38.450
Bear it! Hold back!

21:38.800 --> 21:40.120
<i>What is this?!</i>

21:40.120 --> 21:42.590
<i>It feels like everything's going haywire!</i>

21:42.910 --> 21:49.310
Ah! Maybe this is a sign that part of 
Lady Nolyn's blessing is coming undone!

21:49.310 --> 21:51.400
Everything depends on me now!

21:51.400 --> 21:53.860
No, that has nothing to do with this.

21:54.950 --> 21:56.360
Right!

21:56.360 --> 21:57.840
I could just try them on myself.

21:57.840 --> 22:01.290
No! What am I even thinking?!

22:01.840 --> 22:03.540
You want to try them on, don't you?

22:03.540 --> 22:05.250
No, no, no!

22:07.360 --> 22:09.210
Takumi...
